{"sections":[],"kind":"symbol","primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"final","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"class","kind":"keyword"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"text":"OneDriveCloudFileSystem","kind":"identifier"}],"platforms":["macOS"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"text":"Overview","anchor":"overview","type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"This backend communicates directly with Microsoft’s Graph API — no third-party SDK","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"is required. Authentication is handled via an OAuth 2.0 access token passed as","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"a ","type":"text"},{"code":"Bearer","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" header on every request.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Microsoft Graph supports native path-based addressing using the colon syntax:","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"\/me\/drive\/root:\/path\/to\/item:","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":". This means Ensembles paths map directly to","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"OneDrive paths without any ID resolution or caching — similar to the pCloud backend.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Two initialization paths are available:","type":"text"}]},{"code":["\/\/ Simple: static access token (app manages refresh externally)","let cloudFS = OneDriveCloudFileSystem(accessToken: \"your-token\")","","\/\/ Authenticator: auto-refreshes expired tokens","let cloudFS = OneDriveCloudFileSystem(authenticator: authenticator)"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"text":"Setup","level":2,"anchor":"Setup","type":"heading"},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Register an app in the ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/portal.azure.com\/"},{"text":" under","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"Azure Active Directory → App registrations → New registration","type":"text"}]}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Under "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"Authentication","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":", add a platform: "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Mobile and desktop applications","type":"text"}]}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Set the redirect URI (e.g. ","type":"text"},{"code":"msauth.com.yourapp:\/\/auth","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":")","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Note the "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Application (client) ID","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" from the overview page"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Configure the authenticator and file system:"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"orderedList"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["let config = OneDriveAuthenticator.Configuration(","    clientID: \"your-app-client-id\",","    redirectURI: \"msauth.com.yourapp:\/\/auth\"",")","let authenticator = OneDriveAuthenticator(configuration: config)","try await authenticator.authorize(presenting: window)","","let cloudFS = OneDriveCloudFileSystem(authenticator: authenticator)","let ensemble = CoreDataEnsemble(","    ensembleIdentifier: \"MyStore\",","    persistentStoreURL: storeURL,","    managedObjectModelURL: modelURL,","    cloudFileSystem: cloudFS",")"],"type":"codeListing"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The authenticator stores tokens in the Keychain and refreshes them automatically.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"The default scopes are ","type":"text"},{"code":"Files.ReadWrite","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"code":"offline_access","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" (required for refresh","type":"tex